{
  "description": "Steers through the cases control must handle in the San Martin reference frame (20 km global diagonal on a 0.9652 m local diagonal): far-away steering, slowing on approach as the local distance shrinks, pivots when the target is abeam or behind, an unwrapped heading, and stopping when guidance ends. Distances are global metres.",
  "speed_tolerance_rad_per_s": 0.01,
  "steps": [
